## SQ-MRD-03 | cheese toast, sliced potato tags
@group B
@commands `/dumpall` recipe dump, `/dumptags`
@pass `creativedelight:...cheese_toast` shapeless (Toast + Flaxen Cheese Wedge); `forge:sliced_potato` and `forge:sliced_potatoes` both hold Rustic's slices (More Delight's six potato recipes read the plural, `dishes/ingredients #26`); the four renamed pack tags filled
@fails Depends on: tags
@from batches/r1101/w2_worldgen.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-16
> cdevtest rdetail cheese_toast
> cdevtest tag item forge:sliced_potato
> cdevtest tag item forge:sliced_potatoes
# text query since r1118 (judge-8, 2026-11-18): no recipe has the id moredelight:mashed_potatoes; the four diced potato dishes are moredelight:cooking/diced_potatoes_with_*
> cdevtest rdetail diced_potatoes_with
expect verb=tag kind=item tag=forge:sliced_potatoes .*.*rusticdelight
look cheese toast shapeless (toast + flaxen cheese wedge); both slice tags hold Rustic's slices; More Delight potato recipes show a slice item
reject verb=\S+ .*done=0
